{"title": "BJP Loses Ground in Bihar By-Poll, RJD Suspects Vote Shift", "summary": "The Bharatiya Janata Party (BJP) lost ground in a by-election in Bankipur, Bihar, where the Rashtriya Janata Dal (RJD) suspects vote shifting. The BJP alleged that the RJD shifted votes to Prashant Kishor, who is a close ally of the party's main rival, Nitish Kumar. The opposition and the BJP are now conducting booth-wise reviews. The by-election was held on November 3, with results announced on November 7.", "summary_points": ["The Bharatiya Janata Party (BJP) lost ground in a by-election in Bankipur, Bihar, where the Rashtriya Janata Dal (RJD) suspects vote shifting.", "The BJP alleged that the RJD shifted votes to Prashant Kishor, who is a close ally of the party's main rival, Nitish Kumar.", "The opposition and the BJP are now conducting booth-wise reviews.", "The by-election was held on November 3, with results announced on November 7."], "title_hi": "बिहार में बैंकिपुर के चुनाव में भाजपा ने हार दी, राजद सोचती है मतदाताओं को बदलने की कोशिश", "summary_hi": "बिहार में बैंकिपुर के चुनाव में भाजपा ने हार दी, राजद सोचती है मतदाताओं को बदलने की कोशिश। भाजपा ने आरजेडी को मतदाताओं को बदलने की कोशिश करने का आरोप लगाया, जिसमें प्रशांत किशोर शामिल हैं। विपक्ष और भाजपा अब बooth-वाइज रिव्यू कर रहे हैं। चुनाव 3 नवंबर को हुआ था, जबकि परिणाम 7 नवंबर को घोषित किए गए थे।", "summary_points_hi": ["बिहार में बैंकिपुर के चुनाव में भाजपा ने हार दी, राजद सोचती है मतदाताओं को बदलने की कोशिश।", "भाजपा ने आरजेडी को मतदाताओं को बदलने की कोशिश करने का आरोप लगाया, जिसमें प्रशांत किशोर शामिल हैं।", "विपक्ष और भाजपा अब बooth-वाइज रिव्यू कर रहे हैं।", "चुनाव 3 नवंबर को हुआ था, जबकि परिणाम 7 नवंबर को घोषित किए गए थे।"], "framing": {"center": ["Mathrubhumi English framed the by-election as a test of the BJP's Bihar strategy, highlighting the party's losses in Bankipur.", "ThePrint emphasized the significance of the by-election results for the BJP's chances in the upcoming state elections."]}, "framing_hi": {"center": ["बैंकिपुर में चुनाव को भाजपा की बिहार स्ट्रेटेजी का प्रयोग के रूप में देखा, जिसमें बैंकिपुर में भाजपा की हार पर ध्यान केंद्रित किया।", "द थर्ड प्रिंट ने चुनाव के परिणामों को भाजपा के आगामी राज्य चुनावों के लिए महत्वपूर्णता से देखा।"]}, "topic": "Politics", "region": "India", "image_url": "", "sources": [{"source": "The Print", "owner": "The Print", "lean": "center", "language": "en", "url": "https://news.google.?oc=5", "headline": "CPI(M), CPI(ML) Liberation hail Prashant Kishor’s Bankipur bypoll victory"}, {"source": "The Print", "owner": "The Print", "lean": "center", "language": "en", "url": "https://news.google.?oc=5", "headline": "Nitish, Lalu namesakes fail to make mark in Bihar’s Bankipur bypoll"}, {"source": "Hindustan Times", "owner": "HT Media", "lean": "center", "language": "en", "url": "https://news.google.?oc=5", "headline": "Prashant Kishor Holds Bankipur Bypoll Victory Roadshow in Patna | Videos"}, {"source": "Deccan Herald", "owner": "Deccan Herald", "lean": "center", "language": "en", "url": "https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMi_?oc=5", "headline": "Bankipur Bypoll Results | BJP suspects RJD votes shifted to Prashant Kishor, to conduct booth-wise review"}, {"source": "Deccan Herald", "owner": "Deccan Herald", "lean": "center", "language": "en", "url": "https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMixAFBVV95cUxNVTRfazZFVWE3VHN6b0cxSXItalFzRlhPbzFLR1RMdmlzdFdkalRSVThsWkMyX21jN1h5UEJubFpGc0NuN0dTZVB0eGFwbDV2RUFtVFpNdFlxdkdjeGNEZ1NKNXJTdG9ybzM3SmM3SlRGZzY5dDlYR2lVdkZfOXIyZldFT1JFTmxJWWIyeF9wemEwTUtnNEpHMzBSRjZZWVJERnRCRVFLUEgyd3lWRUQ3MnU2VmZqVllIM2FOQzE4OUtnaVdE?oc=5", "headline": "From Bankipur to Datia: What the bypoll verdict tells BJP and Opposition"}, {"source": "India Today", "owner": "India Today Group", "lean": "right", "language": "en", "url": "https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMicEFVX3lxTFBZenc3SzhNcEJhQTE1em8wRWcxOGVsWHlwWjVGWHZwSFpQRlpVYjFVWHEtREJKZ1QxNEdCSUpsM2RlV0R1c0ZTTjRLNng3dk1LY1pyWHZnYUFXSVdTNVFyWnJVM0dBV29sRG5nbjdIa2w?oc=5"